flowchart LR
  SIG[Signal / task] --> D[Draft message]
  D --> C[Consent + recipient checks]
  C --> A{Approval?}
  A -- yes --> U[User approves exact draft]
  A -- no --> S[Send if policy allows]
  U --> S
  S --> R[Provider receipt]
  R --> M[Metric + audit event]
